 </font></font><br />\r\n						<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">[SITE_NAME]</font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<!--// 100% body table -->', '1'),
(7, 'Tu cuenta se ha verificado', '<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n<title></title>\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">a:hover { text-decoration: underline !important; }\r\n\r\n		@media only screen and (min-width: 640px) {\r\n    	*[class].wrapper { width: 480px !important; }\r\n    	*[class].wrapper__indent { width: 60px !important; }\r\n		}\r\n</style>\r\n<table bgcolor=\"#ebedef\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 13px/24px Arial, sans-serif, Helvetica; color: #939aa4; margin: 0px;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Estado de la cuenta</font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n\r\n			<table align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #c8cace; border-radius: 4px; margin: auto;\" width=\"480\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"background: #ff4800;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ff4800\" height=\"50\" style=\"background: #ff4800;\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 17px/20px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #ffffff;\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/account/img/Foxchanger.png\" style=\"display: block;\" width=\"163\" /></strong></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td style=\"background: #ff4800;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td>\r\n						<p style=\"color: #303030; font: 15px/20px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 25px 0 25px 0; text-align: center;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Estimado/a [NAME]! </font></font><br />\r\n						<br />\r\n						<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Su cuenta&nbsp;de Foxchanger ha sido verificada con &eacute;xito. La pr&oacute;xima vez que inicie sesi&oacute;n, aumentar&aacute;n sus l&iacute;mites de dep&oacute;sito y no tendr&aacute; restricciones.</font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">\r\n						<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 10px 0 25px;\"><a alias=\"button\" href=\"[SITE_LINK]\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font: 17px/40px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #ffffff; display: block; width: 225px; background: #ff4800; border-radius: 4px;\" target=\"_blank\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Mi cuenta</font></font></a></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n\r\n			<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 13px/20px Arial, sans-serif, Helvetica; color: #939aa4; margin: 20px 0 0;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Tienes alguna pregunta? </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Escriba al Servicio de soporte. </font></font><br />\r\n						<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">[SITE_NAME]</font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<!--// 100% body table -->', '1'),
(8, 'Documento Rechazado', '<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n<title></title>\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">a:hover { text-decoration: underline !important; }\r\n\r\n		@media only screen and (min-width: 640px) {\r\n    	*[class].wrapper { width: 480px !important; }\r\n    	*[class].wrapper__indent { width: 60px !important; }\r\n		}\r\n</style>\r\n<table bgcolor=\"#ebedef\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 13px/24px Arial, sans-serif, Helvetica; color: #939aa4; margin: 0px;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Estado de&nbsp;cuenta</font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n\r\n			<table align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #c8cace; border-radius: 4px; margin: auto;\" width=\"480\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"background: #ff4800;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ff4800\" height=\"50\" style=\"background: #ff4800;\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 17px/20px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #ffffff;\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/account/img/Foxchanger.png\" style=\"display: block;\" width=\"163\" /></strong></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td style=\"background: #ff4800;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td>\r\n						<p style=\"color: #303030; font: 15px/20px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 25px 0 25px 0; text-align: center;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Estimado/a [NAME]! </font></font><br />\r\n						<br />\r\n						<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Gracias por el documento que nos ha proporcionado y su colaboraci&oacute;n:</font></font></p>\r\n\r\n						<p style=\"color: #303030; font: 15px/20px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 25px 0 25px 0; text-align: center;\">No obstante, no pudimos confirmar sus detalles en el documento proporcionado y le solicitamos amablemente que nos env&iacute;e un documento de prueba de direcci&oacute;n alternativo.</p>\r\n\r\n						<p style=\"color: #303030; font: 15px/20px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 25px 0 25px 0; text-align: center;\"><strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">[COMMENT]</font></font></strong></p>\r\n\r\n						<p>Los documentos de verificaci&oacute;n de direcci&oacute;n aceptables son:</p>\r\n\r\n						<ul>\r\n							<li>facturas de servicios p&uacute;blicos (calefacci&oacute;n, electricidad, agua, televisi&oacute;n por cable, tel&eacute;fono fijo, alcantarillado, gas, etc.)</li>\r\n							<li>un extracto impreso original de su instituci&oacute;n financiera (banco, tarjeta de cr&eacute;dito/d&eacute;bito, hipoteca, seguro, inversiones: tenga en cuenta que no aceptamos extractos de instituciones financieras que son &uacute;nicamente en l&iacute;nea)</li>\r\n							<li>una carta firmada y sellada de su instituci&oacute;n financiera que confirme su cuenta con ella, su direcci&oacute;n y su nombre completo</li>\r\n							<li>cualquier correspondencia emitida por el gobierno (incluyendo documentos de impuestos, documentos de juzgados)</li>\r\n							<li>su documento de identidad v&aacute;lido, siempre que contenga la direcci&oacute;n registrada en su cuenta de&nbsp;Foxchanger</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n\r\n						<p>Requisitos importantes para los documentos de verificaci&oacute;n de direcci&oacute;n:</p>\r\n\r\n						<ul>\r\n							<li>El documento debe ser emitido en los &uacute;ltimos 90 d&iacute;as.</li>\r\n							<li>Se debe enviar la p&aacute;gina completa de su documento mostrando todas sus esquinas.</li>\r\n							<li>El documento debe contener su nombre completo, su direcci&oacute;n actual y la fecha de emisi&oacute;n del documento. El nombre y el logotipo de la empresa emisora debe estar visible.</li>\r\n							<li>El documento debe enviarse en formato de archivo *.jpg, *.jpeg, *.gif, *.png.</li>\r\n							<li>No aceptamos capturas de pantalla. Por favor env&iacute;e una copia del documento original.</li>\r\n						</ul>\r\n\r\n						<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n						<p>Una vez que inicie sesi&oacute;n en su cuenta, siga las instrucciones en pantalla para enviar sus documentos.</p>\r\n\r\n						<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n						<p>Gracias por su colaboraci&oacute;n.</p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">\r\n						<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 10px 0 25px;\"><a alias=\"button\" href=\"[SITE_LINK]\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font: 17px/40px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #ffffff; display: block; width: 225px; background: #ff4800; border-radius: 4px;\" target=\"_blank\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Mi cuenta</font></font></a></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n\r\n			<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 13px/20px Arial, sans-serif, Helvetica; color: #939aa4; margin: 20px 0 0;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Tienes alguna pregunta? </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Escriba al Servicio de soporte. </font></font><br />\r\n						<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">[SITE_NAME]</font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<!--// 100% body table -->', '1'),
(9, 'Fondos Recibidos', '<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n<title></title>\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">a:hover { text-decoration: underline !important; }\r\n\r\n		@media only screen and (min-width: 640px) {\r\n    	*[class].wrapper { width: 480px !important; }\r\n    	*[class].wrapper__indent { width: 60px !important; }\r\n		}\r\n</style>\r\n<table bgcolor=\"#ebedef\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 13px/24px Arial, sans-serif, Helvetica; color: #939aa4; margin: 0px;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Estado de movimientos</font></font></font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n\r\n			<table align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #c8cace; border-radius: 4px; margin: auto;\" width=\"480\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"background: #ff4800;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ff4800\" height=\"50\" style=\"background: #ff4800;\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 17px/20px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #ffffff;\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/account/img/Foxchanger.png\" style=\"display: block;\" width=\"163\" /></strong></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td style=\"background: #ff4800;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td>\r\n						<p style=\"color: #303030; font: 15px/20px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 25px 0 25px 0; text-align: center;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Estimado [NAME]! </font></font></font></font><br />\r\n						<br />\r\n						<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Se recibi&oacute; una cantidad de fondos igual a [SUM] [CUR] en su cuenta. </font></font></font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&iexcl;Puede ver los detalles de la transacci&oacute;n despu&eacute;s de iniciar sesi&oacute;n en su cuenta!</font></font></font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">\r\n						<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 10px 0 25px;\"><a alias=\"button\" href=\"[SITE_LINK]\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font: 17px/40px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #ffffff; display: block; width: 225px; background: #ff4800; border-radius: 4px;\" target=\"_blank\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Transacci&oacute;n</font></font></font></font></a></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n\r\n			<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 13px/20px Arial, sans-serif, Helvetica; color: #939aa4; margin: 20px 0 0;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Tienes alguna pregunta? </font></font></font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Escriba al Servicio de soporte. </font></font></font></font><br />\r\n						<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">[SITE_NAME]</font></font></font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<!--// 100% body table -->', '1'),
(10, 'Retiro Pendiente', '<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n<title></title>\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">a:hover { text-decoration: underline !important; }\r\n\r\n		@media only screen and (min-width: 640px) {\r\n    	*[class].wrapper { width: 480px !important; }\r\n    	*[class].wrapper__indent { width: 60px !important; }\r\n		}\r\n</style>\r\n<table bgcolor=\"#ebedef\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 13px/24px Arial, sans-serif, Helvetica; color: #939aa4; margin: 0px;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Estado de la transacci&oacute;n</font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n\r\n			<table align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #c8cace; border-radius: 4px; margin: auto;\" width=\"480\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"background: #ff4800;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ff4800\" height=\"50\" style=\"background: #ff4800;\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 17px/20px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #ffffff;\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/account/img/Foxchanger.png\" style=\"display: block;\" width=\"163\" /></strong></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td style=\"background: #ff4800;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td>\r\n						<p style=\"color: #303030; font: 15px/20px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 25px 0 25px 0; text-align: center;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Estimado [NAME]! </font></font><br />\r\n						<br />\r\n						<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">El&nbsp;monto igual a [SUM] [CUR], se dedujo de su cuenta. </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">El tiempo de ejecuci&oacute;n depende del m&eacute;todo de retiro que haya elegido.</font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">\r\n						<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 10px 0 25px;\"><a alias=\"button\" href=\"[SITE_LINK]\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font: 17px/40px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #ffffff; display: block; width: 225px; background: #ff4800; border-radius: 4px;\" target=\"_blank\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Transacci&oacute;n</font></font></a></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n\r\n			<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 13px/20px Arial, sans-serif, Helvetica; color: #939aa4; margin: 20px 0 0;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Tienes alguna pregunta? </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Escriba al Servicio de soporte. </font></font><br />\r\n						<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">[SITE_NAME]</font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<!--// 100% body table -->', '1'),
(11, '¡Cambio de moneda completado!', '<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\">\r\n<title></title>\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">a:hover { text-decoration: underline !important; }\r\n\r\n		@media only screen and (min-width: 640px) {\r\n    	*[class].wrapper { width: 480px !important; }\r\n    	*[class].wrapper__indent { width: 60px !important; }\r\n		}\r\n</style>\r\n<table bgcolor=\"#ebedef\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>\r\n			<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 13px/24px Arial, sans-serif, Helvetica; color: #939aa4; margin: 0px;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Estado de la transacci&oacute;n</font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n\r\n			<table align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wrapper\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #c8cace; border-radius: 4px; margin: auto;\" width=\"480\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td class=\"wrapper__indent\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #wwwwww;\" width=\"30\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" height=\"70\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #wwwwww;\" valign=\"middle\"><a alias=\"site_logo\" href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/account/img/Foxchanger.png\" style=\"display: block;\" width=\"200\" /> </a></td>\r\n						<td class=\"wrapper__indent\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #wwwwww;\" width=\"30\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"background: #882db6;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#882db6\" height=\"50\" style=\"background: #882db6;\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 17px/20px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #ffffff;\"><strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Cambio de moneda completado</font></font></strong></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td style=\"background: #882db6;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td>\r\n						<p style=\"color: #303030; font: 15px/20px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 25px 0 25px 0; text-align: center;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Estimado [NAME]! </font></font><br />\r\n						<br />\r\n						<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Intercambiaste&nbsp;con &eacute;xito [SUM_1] [CUR_1] a [SUM_2] [CUR_2]. Puede verificar el saldo actual y el historial de transacciones despu&eacute;s de iniciar sesi&oacute;n en su cuenta.</font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">&nbsp;</td>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">\r\n						<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 10px 0 25px;\"><a alias=\"button\" href=\"[SITE_LINK]\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font: 17px/40px Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #ffffff; display: block; width: 225px; background: #c42cee; border-radius: 4px;\" target=\"_blank\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Mi cuenta</font></font></a></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n						<td style=\"border-top: 0px solid #dee0e1; \">&nbsp;</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n\r\n			<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n				<tbody>\r\n					<tr>\r\n						<td align=\"center\" height=\"45\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n						<p style=\"font: 13px/20px Arial, sans-serif, Helvetica; color: #939aa4; margin: 20px 0 0;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Tienes alguna pregunta? </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Escriba al Servicio de soporte. </font></font><br />\r\n						<font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">[SITE_NAME]</font></font></p>\r\n						</td>\r\n					</tr>\r\n				</tbody>\r\n			</table>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<!--// 100% body table -->', '1');
