ol-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p>Pague la compra simplemente ingresando su nombre de usuario y contrase&ntilde;a</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div aria-labelledby=\"nav-profile-tab\" class=\"tab-pane\" id=\"nav-profile\" role=\"tabpanel\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-75\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/icon/seller2.png\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge\">1</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p>Realice una verificaci&oacute;n de cuenta simple para que los clientes puedan confiar en usted</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-75\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/icon/seller1.png\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge-2\">2</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p>Cree un nuevo comerciante y comience la integraci&oacute;n con su sitio</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-75\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/icon/seller3.png\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge-2\">3</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p>Publique el formulario HTML en su sitio web y comience a recibir pagos</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4 mb-5\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"foot-merchant\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-5\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center text-white\">Comprar en tiendas de todo el mundo</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-3 mt-5 mb-5\">\r\n<h5 class=\"text-center text-white\">Seguro y a salvo</h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-white\">Compra y no te preocupes por las consecuencias. &iexcl;Si no recibe los productos, le devolveremos el dinero a su cuenta!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-3 mt-5 mb-5\">\r\n<h5 class=\"text-center text-white\">Sistema de facturas</h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-white\">&iexcl;Emite facturas a tus clientes, recibe pagos y retira fondos de tu cuenta en c&oacute;modas instrucciones de pago!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-3 mt-5 mb-5\">\r\n<h5 class=\"text-center text-white\">Tiendas y pago</h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-white\">Pague por bienes y servicios en el sitio. Elija una tienda, ingrese una nota para el pago y haga clic en pagar. &iexcl;Es r&aacute;pido y seguro!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-3 mt-5 mb-5\">\r\n<h5 class=\"text-center text-white\">Cambio de divisas</h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-white\">Intercambie y almacene diferentes monedas en un monedero. &iexcl;Te sorprender&aacute; gratamente el tipo de cambio de las monedas!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"top-merchant\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12  mt-5\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-center\">Crea una cuenta y comienza</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4 mb-5\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"btn btn-success btn-lg\" href=\"https://foxchanger.com/user/register\">Reg&iacute;strate ahora</a></h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\";}', '1'),
(2, 'How it works', 'a:2:{s:7:\"english\";s:4034:\"<div class=\"landing-2\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-5 mt-6\">\r\n<h4>Purchase in two clicks</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Pay in hundreds of stores - you only need to enter your login and password from your account! If something goes wrong - we will refund the money!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row mt-2\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-5\"><a class=\"btn btn-outline-light btn-lg\" href=\"https://foxchanger.com/login\">Sign in</a> <a class=\"btn btn-success btn-lg\" href=\"https://foxchanger.com/account/shops\">Shops and payment</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"top-protect\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-3 mb-3\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"top-badge\">1</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p class=\"text-white\">Safe online shopping across the country</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-3 mb-3\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"top-badge-2\">2</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p class=\"text-white\">Do not need to enter credit card data - just sign in Foxchanger</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-3 mb-3\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"top-badge-2\">3</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p class=\"text-white\">Save time - order in two clicks without complex forms</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-5 mb-5\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-10\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/icon/ok.png\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">Your private information is not disclosed.</h2>\r\n\r\n<h5 class=\"text-center text-muted\">For payment, you only need to enter your e-mail address and password. Billing data is stored in your account and not sent to the merchant.</h5>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"landing-3\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-7 mt-6\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-5 mt-6\">\r\n<h4>Shopping in stores of any state</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Pay for purchases with small or zero commission. You can make purchases in your account or on the seller&#39;s website!</p>\r\n<a class=\"btn btn-light btn-lg\" href=\"https://foxchanger.com/account/shops\">Store explorer</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"top-merchant\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-5 mb-5\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\">You are not happy with a purchase purchase, we have your back?</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mt-1 mb-5\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-100\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/dispute2.png\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mt-1 mb-5\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge\">1</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p>Open a dispute with the seller and describe the cause of dissatisfaction. Seller will inquiry your payment and be able to return the money to your account.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge-2\">2</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p>Not satisfied yet - start a claim. We will get acquainted with the problem and contact the seller. We will conduct a detailed investigation of the problem.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge-2\">3</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p>We will make a fair decision in a short time and return the money to your account. You will get a partial or full refund</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"foot-merchant\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-6\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-center text-white\">Create account and get started</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4 mb-5\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"btn btn-outline-light btn-lg\" href=\"https://foxchanger.com/user/register\">Sign up</a></h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\";s:7:\"spanish\";s:6849:\"<div class=\"landing-2\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-5 mt-6\">\r\n<h4><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Compra en dos clics</font></font></h4>\r\n\r\n<p><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Pague en cientos de tiendas: &iexcl;solo necesita ingresar su nombre de usuario y contrase&ntilde;a desde su cuenta! </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Si algo sale mal, &iexcl;le devolveremos el dinero!</font></font></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row mt-2\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-5\"><a class=\"btn btn-outline-light btn-lg\" href=\"https://foxchanger.com/login\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Iniciar sesi&oacute;n </font></font></a> <a class=\"btn btn-success btn-lg\" href=\"https://foxchanger.com/account/shops\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Tiendas y pago</font></font></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"top-protect\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-3 mb-3\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"top-badge\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">1</font></font></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p class=\"text-white\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Compras en l&iacute;nea seguras en todo el pa&iacute;s</font></font></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-3 mb-3\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"top-badge-2\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">2</font></font></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p class=\"text-white\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">No es necesario ingresar los datos de la tarjeta de cr&eacute;dito, solo inicie sesi&oacute;n Foxchanger</font></font></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-3 mb-3\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"top-badge-2\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">3</font></font></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p class=\"text-white\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Ahorre tiempo: ordene en dos clics sin formularios complejos</font></font></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-5 mb-5\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-10\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/icon/ok.png\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Su informaci&oacute;n privada no se divulga.</font></font></h2>\r\n\r\n<h5 class=\"text-center text-muted\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Para el pago, solo necesita ingresar su direcci&oacute;n de correo electr&oacute;nico y contrase&ntilde;a. </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Los datos de facturaci&oacute;n se almacenan en su cuenta y no se env&iacute;an al comerciante.</font></font></h5>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"landing-3\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-7 mt-6\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-5 mt-6\">\r\n<h4><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Comprar en tiendas de cualquier estado</font></font></h4>\r\n\r\n<p><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Pague las compras con una comisi&oacute;n peque&ntilde;a o cero. </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">&iexcl;Puede realizar compras en su cuenta o en el sitio web del vendedor!</font></font></p>\r\n<a class=\"btn btn-light btn-lg\" href=\"https://foxchanger.com/account/shops\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Explorador de tiendas</font></font></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"top-merchant\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-5 mb-5\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-center\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">No est&aacute; satisfecho con una compra, &iquest;le respaldamos?</font></font></h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mt-1 mb-5\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-100\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/dispute2.png\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-6 mt-1 mb-5\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">1</font></font></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Abre una disputa con el vendedor y describa la causa de la insatisfacci&oacute;n. </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">El vendedor consultar&aacute; su pago y podr&aacute; devolver el dinero a su cuenta.</font></font></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge-2\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">2</font></font></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Todav&iacute;a no est&aacute; satisfecho: inicie un reclamo. </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Nos familiarizaremos con el problema y nos pondremos en contacto con el vendedor. </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Llevaremos a cabo una investigaci&oacute;n detallada del problema.</font></font></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge-2\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">3</font></font></span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Tomaremos una decisi&oacute;n justa en poco tiempo y le devolveremos el dinero a su cuenta. </font><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Recibir&aacute; un reembolso parcial o total</font></font></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"foot-merchant\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-6\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-center text-white\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Crea una cuenta y comienza</font></font></h4>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4 mb-5\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"btn btn-outline-light btn-lg\" href=\"https://foxchanger.com/user/register\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Reg&iacute;strate</font></font></a></h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\";}', '1');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `name`, `content`, `translite`) VALUES
(3, 'For developers', 'a:2:{s:7:\"english\";s:19489:\"<div class=\"header-st mb-head\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-8 col-sm-6 col-xs-7\">\r\n<div class=\"code-editor\">\r\n<div class=\"tabs\">\r\n<div class=\"title -javascript\">For developers</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n<ul class=\"lines\">\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1 </span> <span class=\"comment\">// Publish on your site</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2 </span><span class=\"yellow\">&lt;form method=&quot;POST&quot; action=&quot;https://foxchanger.com/sci/form&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;merchant&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt; </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;item_name&quot; value=&quot;Testing payment&quot;&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;amount&quot; value=&quot;112&quot;&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;currency&quot; value=&quot;debit_base&quot;&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;custom&quot; value=&quot;comment&quot;&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;meta_data&quot; value=&quot;{&#39;product_id&#39;:&#39;5&#39;,&#39;product_description&#39;:&#39;Samsung S9+&#39;}&quot;&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot;&gt;Pay now!&lt;/button&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">10</span><span class=\"yellow\">&lt;form/&gt;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-5\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center\">Simple form and instant payment POST notifications</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-25\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/icon/space.png\" />\r\n<h5 class=\"mt-3\">Fast start</h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"mt-3\">Register your account, go through verification and start accepting payments!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-25\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/icon/ipn.png\" />\r\n<h5 class=\"mt-3\">IPN system</h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"mt-3\">Get notifications about payments to your sites built on any CMS!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-25\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/icon/tool.png\" />\r\n<h5 class=\"mt-3\">Test mode</h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"mt-3\">Special test payment mode for developers without using real money!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"top-merchant mt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-5 mb-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center\">Get payments using the HTML form or on website Foxchanger</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-primary text-center\">How to receive payments?</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge\">1</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p><strong>On your site</strong> - just publish the HTML form and enter payment parameters. User pay for purchase on a special page</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge-2\">2</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p><strong>Shops and payment</strong> - add your store to our categories and the user pay the purchase in your account</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge-2\">3</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p><strong>Invoicing system</strong> - Enter the cost, the recipient and the description of the invoice.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-8\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-100\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/icon/mac-merchant.png\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"foot-merchant\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-5 mb-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center text-white\">Popular deposit methods for users</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-3 mt-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img class=\"w-50 win-img\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/account/img/pay-icon/paypal.png\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-3 mt-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img class=\"w-50 win-img\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/account/img/pay-icon/skrill.png\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-3 mt-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img class=\"w-50 win-img\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/account/img/pay-icon/Neteller.png\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-3 mt-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img class=\"w-50 win-img\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/account/img/pay-icon/payeer.png\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center text-white\">\r\n<p>and other methods</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-5\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center\">Documentation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-muted\">POST form for payment</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-hover table-responsive\">\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Variable</th>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Description</th>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Conditions</th>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Required</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>merchant</code></th>\r\n			<td>Merchant ID in the system Foxchanger. Assigned to the merchant automatically after adding a store to your account. Your store must be moderated</td>\r\n			<td>Not equal to 0</td>\r\n			<td><strong>Yes</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>item_name</code></th>\r\n			<td>Product name or purpose of payment. This item is visible to the payer</td>\r\n			<td>Minimum number of characters 3, maximum - 100</td>\r\n			<td><strong>Yes</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>amount</code></th>\r\n			<td>The sum in any form. The sum is rounded to decimal places. The total amount including commission will be calculated automatically</td>\r\n			<td>Sum is more than 1</td>\r\n			<td><strong>Yes</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>currency</code></th>\r\n			<td>Currency of payment. Available currencies <code>debit_base</code>, <code>debit_extra1</code>, <code>debit_extra2</code>, <code>debit_extra3</code>, <code>debit_extra4</code>, <code>debit_extra5</code></td>\r\n			<td>Only values from the list</td>\r\n			<td><strong>Yes</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>custom</code></th>\r\n			<td>Comment to the payment. For example, the order number in your store. This item is not displayed to the buyer</td>\r\n			<td>Maximum - 100</td>\r\n			<td><strong>No</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>meta_data</code></th>\r\n			<td>Any information you want to attach to this payment transaction. For example, product description , or buyer ID</td>\r\n			<td>Format in JSON</td>\r\n			<td><strong>No</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4\">\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-muted\">IPN notifications</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-hover table-responsive\">\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Variable</th>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Description</th>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Example</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;amount&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>The received amount without commission</td>\r\n			<td><code>100.00</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;fee&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Fee for payment. Paid by the buyer or merchant according to the settings</td>\r\n			<td><code>0.20</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;total&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Total transaction amount including commission</td>\r\n			<td><code>100.20</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;payer&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Buyer username in the system Foxchanger</td>\r\n			<td><code>seifhamdaoui</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;receiver&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Merchant username in the system Foxchanger</td>\r\n			<td><code>studytn</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;status&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>The status of the transaction. Always Value &quot;Confirmed&quot;</td>\r\n			<td><code>Confirmed</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;date&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Transaction date</td>\r\n			<td><code>2018-01-09 03:11:07</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;id_transfer&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Unique transaction number in the system Foxchanger</td>\r\n			<td><code>58954</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;merchant_name&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Merchant store name in the system Foxchanger</td>\r\n			<td><code>ZARA Store</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;merchant_id&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Unique number of merchant in the system Foxchanger</td>\r\n			<td><code>21</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;balance&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Available merchant balance in transaction currency</td>\r\n			<td><code>2100.56</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;item_name&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Name of paid goods</td>\r\n			<td><code>Test payment</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;custom&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Comment on payment, formed by the merchant in the HTML form</td>\r\n			<td><code>INV 1452485</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;hash&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>A unique signature that is used to verify the validity of a notification. A string join is created of the total amount, merchant password, date transaction and transaction ID. The string is encrypted using an algorithm MD5.</td>\r\n			<td><code>C93D3BF7A7C4AFE94B64E30C2CE39F4F</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;meta_data&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>The meta data sent by the merchant, returned as is</td>\r\n			<td><code>{<br />\r\n			&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;product_id&quot;:&quot;5&quot;,<br />\r\n			&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Samsung S9+&quot;<br />\r\n			}</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4\">\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-muted\">Example of a notification handler in PHP</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<div class=\"code-editor\">\r\n<div class=\"tabs\">\r\n<div class=\"title -javascript text-white\">For developers</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n<ul class=\"lines\">\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1 </span> <span class=\"comment\">// Merchant password</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2 </span><span class=\"blue\">$merchant_password</span><span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"yellow\">&quot;t43t43t34t43t34t6545845&quot;</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3 </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4 </span><span class=\"comment\">// Transaction info </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5 </span><span class=\"blue\">$amount<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;amount&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6 </span><span class=\"blue\">$fee<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;fee&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7 </span><span class=\"blue\">$total<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;total&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8 </span><span class=\"blue\">$currency<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;currency&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9 </span><span class=\"blue\">$payer<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;payer&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">10</span><span class=\"blue\">$receiver<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;receiver&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">11</span><span class=\"blue\">$status<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;status&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">12</span><span class=\"blue\">$id_transfer<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;id_transfer&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">13</span><span class=\"blue\">$date<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;date&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">14</span><span class=\"comment\">// Merchant info </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">15</span><span class=\"blue\">$merchant_name<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;merchant_name&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">16</span><span class=\"blue\">$merchant_id<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;merchant_id&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">17</span><span class=\"blue\">$balance<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;balance&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">18</span><span class=\"comment\">// Purchase information </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">19</span><span class=\"blue\">$item_name<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;item_name&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">20</span><span class=\"blue\">$custom<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;custom&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">21</span><span class=\"blue\">$meta_data_string<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;meta_data&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">22</span><span class=\"comment\">// Verification of the transaction </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">23</span><span class=\"blue\">$hash<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;hash&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">24</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">25</span><span class=\"blue\">$hash_string<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span> $total <span class=\"text-white\">.</span><span class=\"yellow\"> &#39;:&#39; </span><span class=\"text-white\">.</span> $merchant_password <span class=\"text-white\">.</span><span class=\"yellow\"> &#39;:&#39; </span><span class=\"text-white\"> . </span> $date <span class=\"text-white\"> . </span><span class=\"yellow\"> &#39;:&#39; </span><span class=\"text-white\"> . </span>$id_transfer<span class=\"white_text\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">26</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">27</span><span class=\"blue\">$user_hash<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span> <span class=\"text-white\">strtoupper(md5(</span><span class=\"blue\">$hash_string</span><span class=\"text-white\">));</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">28</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">29</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">if(</span>$hash_string <span class=\"text-white\"> == </span> $user_hash<span class=\"text-white\">){</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">30</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">{</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">31</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"blue\">$meta_data</span> = json_decode(<span class=\"blue\">$meta_data_string</span>);</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">32</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"blue\">$product_id</span> = <span class=\"blue\">$meta_data<span class=\"text-white\">-&gt;</span>product_id</span>;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">33</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"blue\">$product_description</span> = <span class=\"blue\">$meta_data<span class=\"text-white\">-&gt;</span>product_description</span>;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">34</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;echo <span class=\"yellow\">&quot;Confirmed&quot;</span> ; </span> </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">35</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">} else {</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">36</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;echo <span class=\"yellow\">&quot;Not confirmed&quot;</span> ; </span> </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">37</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">}</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"foot-merchant mt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-6\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-center text-white\">Create account and get started</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4 mb-5\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"btn btn-outline-light btn-lg\" href=\"https://foxchanger.com/user/register\">Sign up</a></h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\";s:7:\"spanish\";s:20050:\"<div class=\"header-st mb-head\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-8 col-sm-6 col-xs-7\">\r\n<div class=\"code-editor\">\r\n<div class=\"tabs\">\r\n<div class=\"title -javascript\">Para desarrolladores</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n<ul class=\"lines\">\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1 </span> <span class=\"comment\">// Publica en tu sitio</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2 </span><span class=\"yellow\">&lt;form method=&quot;POST&quot; action=&quot;https://foxchanger.com/sci/form&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;merchant&quot; value=&quot;7&quot;&gt; </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;item_name&quot; value=&quot;Testing payment&quot;&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;amount&quot; value=&quot;112&quot;&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;currency&quot; value=&quot;debit_base&quot;&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;custom&quot; value=&quot;comment&quot;&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;meta_data&quot; value=&quot;{&#39;product_id&#39;:&#39;5&#39;,&#39;product_description&#39;:&#39;Samsung S9+&#39;}&quot;&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9 </span><span class=\"red\"> &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot;&gt;Pay now!&lt;/button&gt;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">10</span><span class=\"yellow\">&lt;form/&gt;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-5\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center\">Formulario simple y notificaciones POST de pago instant&aacute;neo</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-25\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/icon/space.png\" />\r\n<h5 class=\"mt-3\">Comienzo r&aacute;pido</h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"mt-3\">&iexcl;Registre su cuenta, realice la verificaci&oacute;n y comience a aceptar pagos!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-25\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/icon/ipn.png\" />\r\n<h5 class=\"mt-3\">Sistema IPN</h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"mt-3\">&iexcl;Recibe&nbsp;notificaciones sobre pagos a sus sitios basados ​​en cualquier CMS!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 mt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-25\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/icon/tool.png\" />\r\n<h5 class=\"mt-3\">Modo de prueba</h5>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"mt-3\">&iexcl;Modo de pago de prueba especial para desarrolladores sin usar dinero real!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"top-merchant mt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-5 mb-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center\">Obtenga pagos utilizando el formulario HTML o en el sitio web Foxchanger</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-primary text-center\">&iquest;C&oacute;mo recibir pagos?</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge\">1</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p><strong>En su sitio:</strong>&nbsp;Simplemente publique el formulario HTML e ingrese los par&aacute;metros de pago. El usuario paga por la compra en una p&aacute;gina especial</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge-2\">2</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p><strong>Tiendas y pago: </strong>Agregue su tienda a nuestras categor&iacute;as y el usuario pagar&aacute; la compra en su cuenta</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"step-badge-2\">3</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 mt-3\">\r\n<p><strong>Sistema de facturaci&oacute;n: </strong>ingrese el costo, el destinatario y la descripci&oacute;n de la factura.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-8\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"w-100\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/escrow/img/icon/html.jpg\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"foot-merchant\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-5 mb-4\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center text-white\">M&eacute;todos de dep&oacute;sito populares</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-3 mt-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img class=\"w-50 win-img\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/account/img/pay-icon/paypal.png\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-3 mt-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img class=\"w-50 win-img\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/account/img/pay-icon/skrill.png\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-3 mt-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img class=\"w-50 win-img\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/account/img/pay-icon/Neteller.png\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-3 mt-4 mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"><img class=\"w-50 win-img\" src=\"https://foxchanger.com/assets/themes/account/img/pay-icon/payeer.png\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-5\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-center\">Documentaci&oacute;n</h3>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-muted\">Formulario POST para pago</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-hover table-responsive\">\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Variable</th>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Descripci&oacute;n</th>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Condiciones</th>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Requerido</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>merchant</code></th>\r\n			<td>Identificaci&oacute;n del comerciante en el sistema Foxchanger. Asignado al comerciante autom&aacute;ticamente despu&eacute;s de agregar una tienda a su cuenta. Tu tienda debe ser revisada</td>\r\n			<td>No es igual a 0</td>\r\n			<td><b>Si</b></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>item_name</code></th>\r\n			<td>Nombre del producto o prop&oacute;sito del pago. Este art&iacute;culo es visible para el pagador</td>\r\n			<td>N&uacute;mero m&iacute;nimo de caracteres 3, m&aacute;ximo: 100</td>\r\n			<td><strong>Si</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>amount</code></th>\r\n			<td>La suma en cualquier forma. La suma se redondea a decimales. El importe total, incluida la comisi&oacute;n, se calcular&aacute; autom&aacute;ticamente.</td>\r\n			<td>Suma es m&aacute;s de 1</td>\r\n			<td><b>Si</b></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>currency</code></th>\r\n			<td>Moneda de pago. Monedas disponibles debit_base, debit_extra1, debit_extra2, debit_extra3, debit_extra4,debit_extra5</td>\r\n			<td>Solo valores de la lista</td>\r\n			<td><strong>Si</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>custom</code></th>\r\n			<td>Comentario al pago. Por ejemplo, el n&uacute;mero de pedido en su tienda. Este art&iacute;culo no se muestra al comprador</td>\r\n			<td>M&aacute;ximo: 100</td>\r\n			<td><strong>No</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>meta_data</code></th>\r\n			<td>Cualquier informaci&oacute;n que desee adjuntar a esta transacci&oacute;n de pago. Por ejemplo, descripci&oacute;n del producto o ID del comprador</td>\r\n			<td>Formato en JSON</td>\r\n			<td><strong>No</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4\">\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-muted\">Notificaciones IPN</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4\">\r\n<table class=\"table table-hover table-responsive\">\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Variable</th>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Descripci&oacute;n</th>\r\n			<th scope=\"col\">Ejemplo</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;amount&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>El importe recibido sin comisi&oacute;n</td>\r\n			<td><code>100.00</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;fee&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Tasa de pago. Pagado por el comprador o comerciante de acuerdo con la configuraci&oacute;n</td>\r\n			<td><code>0.20</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;total&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Monto total de la transacci&oacute;n, incluida la comisi&oacute;n</td>\r\n			<td><code>100.20</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;payer&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Nombre de usuario del comerciante en el sistema Foxchanger</td>\r\n			<td><code>seifhamdaoui</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;receiver&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Nombre de usuario del comprador en el sistema Foxchanger</td>\r\n			<td><code>studytn</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;status&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>El estado de la transacci&oacute;n. Valor siempre &quot;confirmado&quot;</td>\r\n			<td><code>Confirmed</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;date&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Fecha de Transacci&oacute;n</td>\r\n			<td><code>2018-01-09 03:11:07</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;id_transfer&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>N&uacute;mero de transacci&oacute;n &uacute;nico en el sistema Foxchanger</td>\r\n			<td><code>58954</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;merchant_name&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Nombre de la tienda del comerciante en el sistema Foxchanger</td>\r\n			<td><code>ZARA Store</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;merchant_id&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>N&uacute;mero &uacute;nico de comerciante en el sistema Foxchanger</td>\r\n			<td><code>21</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;balance&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Saldo comercial disponible en moneda de transacci&oacute;n</td>\r\n			<td><code>2100.56</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;item_name&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Nombre de bienes pagados</td>\r\n			<td><code>Test payment</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;custom&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Comentario sobre el pago, formado por el comerciante en el formulario HTML</td>\r\n			<td><code>INV 1452485</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;hash&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Una firma &uacute;nica que se utiliza para verificar la validez de una notificaci&oacute;n. Se crea una uni&oacute;n de cadena del monto total, la contrase&ntilde;a del comerciante, la fecha de la transacci&oacute;n y la identificaci&oacute;n de la transacci&oacute;n. La cadena se cifra utilizando un algoritmo MD5.</td>\r\n			<td><code>C93D3BF7A7C4AFE94B64E30C2CE39F4F</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th><code>$_POST[&#39;meta_data&#39;]</code></th>\r\n			<td>Los metadatos enviados por el comerciante, devueltos como est&aacute;n</td>\r\n			<td><code>{<br />\r\n			&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;product_id&quot;:&quot;5&quot;,<br />\r\n			&nbsp;&nbsp;&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Samsung S9+&quot;<br />\r\n			}</code></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4\">\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-muted\">Ejemplo de un manejador de notificaciones en PHP</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<div class=\"code-editor\">\r\n<div class=\"tabs\">\r\n<div class=\"title -javascript text-white\">Para desarrolladores</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n<ul class=\"lines\">\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">1 </span> <span class=\"comment\">// Contrase&ntilde;a de comerciante</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2 </span><span class=\"blue\">$merchant_password</span><span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"yellow\">&quot;t43t43t34t43t34t6545845&quot;</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3 </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4 </span><span class=\"comment\">// Informaci&oacute;n de la transacci&oacute;n </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5 </span><span class=\"blue\">$amount<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;amount&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6 </span><span class=\"blue\">$fee<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;fee&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">7 </span><span class=\"blue\">$total<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;total&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">8 </span><span class=\"blue\">$currency<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;currency&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">9 </span><span class=\"blue\">$payer<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;payer&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">10</span><span class=\"blue\">$receiver<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;receiver&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">11</span><span class=\"blue\">$status<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;status&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">12</span><span class=\"blue\">$id_transfer<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;id_transfer&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">13</span><span class=\"blue\">$date<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;date&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">14</span><span class=\"comment\">// Informaci&oacute;n del comerciante </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">15</span><span class=\"blue\">$merchant_name<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;merchant_name&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">16</span><span class=\"blue\">$merchant_id<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;merchant_id&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">17</span><span class=\"blue\">$balance<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;balance&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">18</span><span class=\"comment\">// Informaci&oacute;n de compra </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">19</span><span class=\"blue\">$item_name<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;item_name&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">20</span><span class=\"blue\">$custom<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;custom&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">21</span><span class=\"blue\">$meta_data_string<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;meta_data&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">22</span><span class=\"comment\">// Verificaci&oacute;n de la transacci&oacute;n </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">23</span><span class=\"blue\">$hash<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span><span class=\"orange\">$_POST[</span><span class=\"yellow\">&#39;hash&#39;</span><span class=\"orange\">]</span><span class=\"text-white\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">24</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">25</span><span class=\"blue\">$hash_string<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span> $total <span class=\"text-white\">.</span><span class=\"yellow\"> &#39;:&#39; </span><span class=\"text-white\">.</span> $merchant_password <span class=\"text-white\">.</span><span class=\"yellow\"> &#39;:&#39; </span><span class=\"text-white\"> . </span> $date <span class=\"text-white\"> . </span><span class=\"yellow\"> &#39;:&#39; </span><span class=\"text-white\"> . </span>$id_transfer<span class=\"white_text\">;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">26</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">27</span><span class=\"blue\">$user_hash<span class=\"text-white\"> = </span> <span class=\"text-white\">strtoupper(md5(</span><span class=\"blue\">$hash_string</span><span class=\"text-white\">));</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">28</span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">29</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">if(</span>$hash_string <span class=\"text-white\"> == </span> $user_hash<span class=\"text-white\">){</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">30</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">{</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">31</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"blue\">$meta_data</span> = json_decode(<span class=\"blue\">$meta_data_string</span>);</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">32</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"blue\">$product_id</span> = <span class=\"blue\">$meta_data<span class=\"text-white\">-&gt;</span>product_id</span>;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">33</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"blue\">$product_description</span> = <span class=\"blue\">$meta_data<span class=\"text-white\">-&gt;</span>product_description</span>;</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">34</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;echo <span class=\"yellow\">&quot;Confirmed&quot;</span> ; </span> </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">35</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">} else {</span></span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">36</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;echo <span class=\"yellow\">&quot;Not confirmed&quot;</span> ; </span> </span></li>\r\n	<li class=\"line\"><span class=\"linenumber\">37</span><span class=\"blue\"><span class=\"text-white\">}</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"foot-merchant mt-5\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-6\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-center text-white\">Crea una cuenta y comienza</h4>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12 mt-4 mb-5\">\r\n<h4 class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"btn btn-outline-light btn-lg\" href=\"https://foxchanger.com/user/register\">Reg&iacute;strate</a></h4>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\";}', '1'),
(4, 'Help', 'a:2:{s:7:\"english\";s:144:\"<div class=\"header-st mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n<h3>Help</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\";s:7:\"spanish\";s:329:\"<div class=\"header-st mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n<h3><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Ayuda</font></font></font></font></h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\";}', '1');
