(6, 'Privacy policy', 'a:2:{s:7:\"english\";s:13759:\"<div class=\"header-st mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n<h3>Privacy policy</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n<p class=\"lead\">This license agreement (hereinafter referred to as the &laquo;Agreement&raquo;) constitutes a contract between Denis A. Siminivtsev, who the author of and the owner of the exclusive right to the &laquo;Foxchanger&raquo; (hereinafter referred to as the &laquo;Copyright Owner&raquo;), and you (hereinafter referred to as the &laquo;User&raquo;). This Agreement contains definitions and conditions under which the User can use &laquo;Foxchanger&raquo;.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5>Terms and Definitions</h5>\r\n\r\n<p>All terms given in this section of the Agreement shall have the following meaning for this Agreement only, and shall not be construed to suggest otherwise when used in respect of the conditions set forth in this Agreement.<br />\r\n<strong>Foxchanger</strong> &ndash; means the software distributed on the site http://foxchanger.com/ or its subdomains.<br />\r\n<strong>Program</strong> &mdash; means the &laquo;Foxchanger&raquo;.<br />\r\n<strong>Program-based Derivative</strong> &mdash; means any program, work or information created by the User or a third party with using the Program or any of its parts.<br />\r\n<strong>Use of the Program</strong> &mdash; means any actions related to operation of the Program according to its purpose.<br />\r\n<strong>Domain Name</strong> &mdash; means a unique alphanumeric name intended to identify a resource on the Internet.<br />\r\n<strong>Server</strong> &mdash; means a computer to which the Program is installed.<br />\r\n<strong>Full License</strong> &mdash; means the the right to Use the Program (one copy) on one Server provided by the Copyright Owner to the User for unlimited time.<br />\r\n<strong>Additional License</strong> &mdash; means the time unlimited right to Use the Program on one Domain Name in addition to the number of Domain Names declared while the Full License was purchased.<br />\r\n<strong>Reseller</strong> &mdash; means a legal entity or a private entrepreneur empowered to distribute the Full Licenses and the Additional Licenses.<br />\r\n<strong>Confidential Information</strong> &mdash; means the contents of the Program (source code), all the copies of the Program as well as all the derivative works related to the Program, including, but not limited to, all the upgrades, modifications.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5>1. General provisions</h5>\r\n\r\n<p>The User shall Use the Program within the bounds of this Agreement only. By Using the Program, the User thus consents to the conditions set forth in this Agreement. If the User does not wish to be bound by the conditions of this Agreement, he shall not Use the Program.<br />\r\nThe Copyright Owner notifies the User that the Program is not sold to the User, but, in accordance with this Agreement, the User gains the right to Use the Program under a simple non-exclusive license.<br />\r\nEvery Use of the Program is subject to this Agreement. Any Use of the Program or any of its parts, which contradicts the conditions of this Agreement, is prohibited. If the law of the User&#39;s country makes a provision for a different order of using similar products, the User has the right to Use the Program only in the way and within the bounds stipulated by this Agreement.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5>2. Grant of license</h5>\r\n\r\n<p>The Copyright Owner provides the User with the Full License under a simple non-exclusive license in the entire world only after the User pays the compensation on the site https://foxchanger.com/ or to the Reseller provided that the User declares the number of Domain Names for which the Full License is purchased and through which the Program will be available on the Internet. The Copyright Owner provides the User with the Additional Storefront License under a simple non-exclusive license in the entire world only after the User pays the compensation on the site https://foxchanger.com/ or to the Reseller, provided that the User declares for which his Full License the Additional License is obtained.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5>3. Exclusive right and limitations</h5>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Exclusive right:</strong><br />\r\nThe Copyright Owner owns personal non-property copyrights and an exclusive right to the Program, as well as to all the copies and all the derivative works, related to the Program, including, but not limited to, to all the upgrades and modifications.<br />\r\nThe Copyright Owner has the right to:<br />\r\n- notify the User that the copy of the Program is illegal and is used without the Full License or the Additional License.<br />\r\n<strong>Limitations:</strong><br />\r\nThe User has no right to:<br />\r\n- make copies of the Program and let a third party copy the Program without obtaining an independent Full License;<br />\r\n- use upgrades of the Program and/or the Program of the versions that have been released by the Copyright Owner before the User has purchased the Full License, as well as after the expiration of one calendar year from the date on which the User has purchased the Full License, unless the User has purchased a secondary right for such Full License to use these upgrades of the Program and new versions of the Program on the https://foxchanger.com/ website, and such right is not active;<br />\r\n- make the Program available on a greater number of Domain Names than declared while the Full License was purchased, if no appropriate number of the Additional Licenses was obtained for them;<br />\r\n- extract, excerpt or use any part of the Program to create any Program-based Derivatives as well as provide such possibility to a third party;<br />\r\n- sell, transfer, obligate, license, sublicense, rent, lease, give for temporary use, yield or convey (by selling, exchanging, giving as a gift, by law, or in any other way) the Program, any of its copies (or any of its parts), the Full License or the Additional License and other rights to them, partially or in full, to a third party without a prior written consent of the Copyright Owner;<br />\r\n- remove, hide, modify or make barely visible any copyright, trademark or other proprietary notices contained within any part of the Program without a prior written consent of the Copyright Owner;<br />\r\n- prevent the Copyright Owner from obtaining information about the Use of the Program.<br />\r\nThe User may not remove, disable or modify the part of the Program source code that verifies the Program authenticity and ascertains whether the User has the Full License or the Additional License.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5>4. Confidentiality</h5>\r\n\r\n<p>The User pledges not to disclose Confidential Information, protect from and prevent unauthorized disclosure of the Confidential Information, and take appropriate measures to protect Confidential Information. If the information, which is confidential according to this Agreement, becomes available to a third party without a consent of the Copyright Owner, the User agrees to indemnify the Copyright Owner for all suffered damages.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5>5. Warranties and limitations</h5>\r\n\r\n<p>The Program is provided &quot;AS IS&quot; with all possible malfunction and in the state that is actual by the time the Copyright Owner provides the User with the Full License or the Additional License.<br />\r\nUnder no circumstances the Copyright Owner guarantees error-free and uninterrupted performance of the Program and that the Program will meet the requirements of the User as well as the Copyright Owner disclaims any other warranties to the extent to which it is permitted by the effective law.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5>6. Liability</h5>\r\n\r\n<p>The User assumes all the risks related to the performance and the Use of the Program, including the risk of not getting the expected profit, the risk of a software failure after the Program is installed, etc.<br />\r\nUnder no circumstances the Copyright Owner is liable to the User for any damages (including, but not limited to, any loss of profits and confidential or other information, the damages caused by an interruption of the business, loss of revenue, turnover, business reputation or data, neglected business opportunities, any indirect, incidental, special, punitive or consequential damages) related to the Use of the Program or impossibility to Use the Program.<br />\r\nIn the event that the law of the User&#39;s country concedes no limitation of liability, or the liability of the Copyright Owner is recognized by the competent court, the Copyright Owner will be liable only for actual damage incurred from Using the Program if the damage is caused by a tort of the Copyright Owner, or if the damage is caused by the reasons that the Copyright Owner knew or should have known. The maximum amount of liability of the Copyright Owner is limited to the amount of the compensation that the User paid for one Full License.<br />\r\nThe limitations of liability of the Copyright Owner that are specified in this section of the Agreement apply to the Program and all associated objects.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5>7. Termination of the License and Agreement</h5>\r\n\r\n<p>The Agreement is effective until terminated. The Agreement and the Full License together with the appropriate Additional Licenses are also terminated immediately after the User violates any part of this Agreement without any additional notice from the Copyright Owner. And the User consents to immediately remove the Program together with all copies, modifications and upgrades, and any Program-based Derivatives.<br />\r\nThe territory for this Agreement shall be the entire world. The User has the right to terminate the Full License together with the appropriate Additional Licenses at any time by discontinuing the Agreement and removing the Program together with all its copies, modifications and upgrades, and Program-based Derivatives, along with sending an appropriate notification to the Copyright Owner. The Agreement will be deemed terminated from the moment the Copyright Owner receives the notification from the User.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5>8. Final Provisions</h5>\r\n\r\n<p>This Agreement complies with the effective law of the Russian Federation. The appropriate law to interpret this Agreement and all relationships coming from the scope of the Agreement is the substantive and the adjective law of the Russian Federation..<br />\r\nIf any condition of this Agreement for any reason becomes unenforceable, or is voided or declared invalid by the competent court, then it is regarded as an omission from the text of this Agreement, which, however, shall by no means affect the legitimacy and validity of the other conditions.<br />\r\nThe section headings in the text of the Agreement are for convenience only and have no independent legal force, and shall not be interpreted in relation to the conditions of the Agreement.<br />\r\nThe User acknowledges that he has read this Agreement carefully and understood it completely, and agrees to accept its terms and conditions.<br />\r\nThe Copyright Owner may unilaterally change this Agreement. The User is notified of the changes through a notice on the site https://foxchanger.com/ where the text of the changes is published. The changes in the conditions of the Agreement shall come into force on the date of publishing on the site https://foxchanger.com/, unless otherwise is specified in the publication, and become mandatory for acceptance and satisfaction by the User for further Use of the Program.<br />\r\nThe User acknowledges that the Copyright Owner may suffer damage if the conditions of this Agreement are not respected, and therefore the User agrees that the Copyright Owner has the right to use any form of protecting the violated rights and legitimate interests, including the direct appeal to the appropriate court without a necessity to comply with the claim settlement procedure.<br />\r\nAny dispute arising out or in connection with this Agreement, including any question regarding its interpretation, execution, termination or validity shall be finally settled by arbitration under the Rules of the International Commercial Arbitration Court at the Chamber of Commerce and Industry of the Russian Federation http://mkas.tpprf.ru/ru/reglamentmkas.php (hereinafter referred to as the &quot;Rules&quot;), which Rules are deemed to be incorporated by reference into this section. The arbitration panel shall consist of one (1) arbitrator selected in accordance with the Rules. The language to be used in the arbitral proceeding shall be Russian. The governing law of the Agreement shall be the substantive law of Russian Federation. The arbitration shall be held in Moscow, Russian Federation. The injunctive relief for the subject of dispute may be only suspension of recovery on the basis of the enforced document questioned by the plaintiff or any other document under which penalties are recovered on non-acceptable basis. The plaintiff shall bear its own and the other Party&#39;s costs associated with the resolution or arbitration of any dispute, and all fees and other costs of the arbitration proceeding shall be paid by the plaintiff. The award rendered by the arbitration shall be final and binding upon both Parties and judgment upon the award may be entered in any court having jurisdiction thereof.<br />\r\nThe Parties acknowledge the legal validity of the documents sent by email. The documents sent by the Copyright Owner are considered created in the proper written form if they are sent from support@foxchanger.com and/or manager@foxchanger.com.<br />\r\nThe Program is protected by the law of the Russian Federation and international legislation on copyright and intellectual property.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&copy; 2020 Foxchanger</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\";s:7:\"spanish\";s:44796:\"<div class=\"header-st mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n<h3>Pol&iacute;tica de privacidad</h3>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-12\">\r\n<p class=\"lead\">Este acuerdo de licencia (en lo sucesivo, el &laquo;Acuerdo&raquo;) constituye un contrato entre Luis Alfredo Arias, quien es el autor y el propietario del derecho exclusivo del &laquo;Foxchanger&raquo; (en lo sucesivo, el &laquo;Propietario de los derechos de autor&raquo;), y usted (en lo sucesivo, el &laquo;Usuario&raquo;). Este Acuerdo contiene definiciones y condiciones bajo las cuales el Usuario puede usar &laquo;Foxchanger&raquo;.</p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0.5rem; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-weight:500; line-height:1.2; color:#212529; font-size:1.25rem; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; letter-spacing:normal; orphans:2; text-align:left; text-transform:none; white-space:normal; widows:2; word-spacing:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">T&eacute;rminos y definiciones</font></font></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1rem; text-align:left; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Todos los t&eacute;rminos dados en esta secci&oacute;n del Acuerdo tendr&aacute;n el siguiente significado para este Acuerdo solamente, y no se interpretar&aacute;n para sugerir lo contrario cuando se usen con respecto a las condiciones establecidas en este Acuerdo.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:bolder\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Foxchanger</font></font></strong><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">&nbsp;: significa el software distribuido en el sitio http://foxchanger.com/ o sus subdominios.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:bolder\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Programa</font></font></strong><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">&nbsp;- significa &laquo;Foxchanger&raquo;.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:bolder\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Derivado basado en el</font></font></strong><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">&nbsp;<strong>programa</strong>: significa cualquier programa, trabajo o informaci&oacute;n creada por el Usuario o un tercero con el uso del Programa o cualquiera de sus partes.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:bolder\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Uso del Programa</font></font></strong><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">&nbsp;: significa cualquier acci&oacute;n relacionada con la operaci&oacute;n del Programa de acuerdo con su prop&oacute;sito.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:bolder\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Nombre de dominio</font></font></strong><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">&nbsp;: significa un nombre alfanum&eacute;rico &uacute;nico destinado a identificar un recurso en Internet.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:bolder\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Servidor</font></font></strong><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">- significa una computadora en la que est&aacute; instalado el Programa.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:bolder\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Licencia completa</font></font></strong><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">&nbsp;: significa el derecho a usar el programa (una copia) en un servidor proporcionado por el propietario de los derechos de autor al usuario por tiempo ilimitado.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:bolder\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Licencia adicional</font></font></strong><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">&nbsp;: significa el derecho ilimitado de usar el Programa en un Nombre de dominio adem&aacute;s del n&uacute;mero de Nombres de dominio declarados mientras se compr&oacute; la Licencia completa.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:bolder\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Revendedor</font></font></strong><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">&nbsp;: significa una entidad legal o un empresario privado facultado para distribuir las Licencias completas y las Licencias adicionales.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:bolder\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Informaci&oacute;n confidencial</font></font></strong><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">&nbsp;: significa el contenido del Programa (c&oacute;digo fuente), todas las copias del Programa, as&iacute; como todos los trabajos derivados relacionados con el Programa, incluidas, entre otras, todas las actualizaciones y modificaciones.</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0.5rem; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-weight:500; line-height:1.2; color:#212529; font-size:1.25rem; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; letter-spacing:normal; orphans:2; text-align:left; text-transform:none; white-space:normal; widows:2; word-spacing:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">1. Disposiciones generales</font></font></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1rem; text-align:left; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El Usuario utilizar&aacute; el Programa dentro de los l&iacute;mites de este Acuerdo &uacute;nicamente.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Al utilizar el Programa, el Usuario acepta las condiciones establecidas en este Acuerdo.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Si el Usuario no desea estar sujeto a las condiciones de este Acuerdo, no utilizar&aacute; el Programa.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El Propietario de los derechos de autor notifica al Usuario que el Programa no se vende al Usuario, pero, de conformidad con este Acuerdo, el Usuario obtiene el derecho de Usar el Programa bajo una simple licencia no exclusiva.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Cada uso del programa est&aacute; sujeto a este Acuerdo.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Se proh&iacute;be cualquier uso del Programa o cualquiera de sus partes, que contradiga las condiciones de este Acuerdo.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Si la ley del pa&iacute;s del Usuario estipula un orden diferente de uso de productos similares, el Usuario tiene derecho a usar el Programa solo en la forma y dentro de los l&iacute;mites estipulados por este Acuerdo.</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0.5rem; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-weight:500; line-height:1.2; color:#212529; font-size:1.25rem; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; letter-spacing:normal; orphans:2; text-align:left; text-transform:none; white-space:normal; widows:2; word-spacing:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">2. Concesi&oacute;n de licencia.</font></font></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1rem; text-align:left; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El propietario de los derechos de autor proporciona al usuario la licencia completa bajo una licencia simple no exclusiva en todo el mundo solo despu&eacute;s de que el usuario paga la compensaci&oacute;n en el sitio https://foxchanger.com/ o al revendedor siempre que el usuario declare el n&uacute;mero de nombres de dominio para los que se compra la licencia completa y a trav&eacute;s de los cuales el programa estar&aacute; disponible en Internet.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El propietario de los derechos de autor le proporciona al usuario la licencia de escaparate adicional bajo una licencia simple no exclusiva en todo el mundo solo despu&eacute;s de que el usuario paga la compensaci&oacute;n en el sitio https://foxchanger.com/ o al revendedor, siempre que el usuario declare para lo cual se obtiene su Licencia Completa, la Licencia Adicional.</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0.5rem; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-weight:500; line-height:1.2; color:#212529; font-size:1.25rem; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; letter-spacing:normal; orphans:2; text-align:left; text-transform:none; white-space:normal; widows:2; word-spacing:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">3. Derecho exclusivo y limitaciones</font></font></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1rem; text-align:left; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:bolder\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Derecho exclusivo:</font></font></strong><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">el propietario de los derechos de autor posee derechos de autor personales que no pertenecen a la propiedad y un derecho exclusivo al Programa, as&iacute; como a todas las copias y todos los trabajos derivados, relacionados con el Programa, incluidas, entre otras, todas las actualizaciones y modificaciones</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El propietario de los derechos de autor tiene derecho a:</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">- notificar al usuario que la copia del programa es ilegal y se utiliza sin la licencia completa o la licencia adicional.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box; font-weight:bolder\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Limitaciones:</font></font></strong><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">el usuario no tiene derecho a:</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">- hacer copias del programa y dejar que un tercero copie el programa sin obtener una licencia completa independiente;</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">- utilice las actualizaciones del Programa y / o el Programa de las versiones que el Propietario de los derechos de autor haya publicado antes de que el Usuario haya comprado la Licencia completa, as&iacute; como despu&eacute;s de la expiraci&oacute;n de un a&ntilde;o calendario a partir de la fecha en que el Usuario haya comprado la Licencia completa, a menos que el Usuario haya comprado un derecho secundario para que dicha Licencia completa use estas actualizaciones del Programa y las nuevas versiones del Programa en el sitio web https://foxchanger.com/, y dicho derecho no est&eacute; activo;</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">- hacer que el Programa est&eacute; disponible en un mayor n&uacute;mero de Nombres de Dominio que los declarados mientras se compr&oacute; la Licencia Completa, si no se obtuvo el n&uacute;mero apropiado de Licencias Adicionales para ellos;</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">- extraer, extraer o utilizar cualquier parte del Programa para crear cualquier Derivado basado en el Programa, as&iacute; como proporcionar dicha posibilidad a un tercero;</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">- vender, transferir, obligar, licenciar, sublicenciar, alquilar, arrendar, dar para uso temporal, ceder o transmitir (mediante la venta, el intercambio, la donaci&oacute;n, la ley o de cualquier otra forma) el Programa, cualquiera de sus copias (o cualquiera de sus partes), la Licencia completa o la Licencia adicional y otros derechos sobre ellas, parcial o totalmente, a un tercero sin un consentimiento previo por escrito del Propietario de los derechos de autor;</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">- eliminar, ocultar, modificar o hacer apenas visibles los derechos de autor, marca registrada u otros avisos de propiedad contenidos en cualquier parte del Programa sin un consentimiento previo por escrito del Propietario del Copyright;</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">- evitar que el propietario de los derechos de autor obtenga informaci&oacute;n sobre el uso del programa.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El Usuario no puede eliminar, deshabilitar o modificar la parte del c&oacute;digo fuente del Programa que verifica la autenticidad del Programa y determina si el Usuario tiene la Licencia Completa o la Licencia Adicional.</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0.5rem; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-weight:500; line-height:1.2; color:#212529; font-size:1.25rem; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; letter-spacing:normal; orphans:2; text-align:left; text-transform:none; white-space:normal; widows:2; word-spacing:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">4. confidencialidad</font></font></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1rem; text-align:left; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El usuario se compromete a no divulgar informaci&oacute;n confidencial, proteger y prevenir la divulgaci&oacute;n no autorizada de la informaci&oacute;n confidencial, y tomar las medidas apropiadas para proteger la informaci&oacute;n confidencial.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Si la informaci&oacute;n, que es confidencial de acuerdo con este Acuerdo, se pone a disposici&oacute;n de un tercero sin el consentimiento del Propietario del Copyright, el Usuario acepta indemnizar al Propietario del Copyright por todos los da&ntilde;os sufridos.</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0.5rem; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-weight:500; line-height:1.2; color:#212529; font-size:1.25rem; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; letter-spacing:normal; orphans:2; text-align:left; text-transform:none; white-space:normal; widows:2; word-spacing:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">5. Garant&iacute;as y limitaciones.</font></font></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1rem; text-align:left; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El Programa se proporciona &quot;TAL CUAL&quot; con todos los posibles fallos de funcionamiento y en el estado actual en el momento en que el Propietario de los derechos de autor le proporciona al Usuario la Licencia completa o la Licencia adicional.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Bajo ninguna circunstancia, el Propietario de los derechos de autor garantiza el funcionamiento ininterrumpido y sin errores del Programa y que el Programa cumplir&aacute; con los requisitos del Usuario y el Propietario de los derechos de autor renuncia a cualquier otra garant&iacute;a en la medida en que lo permita la ley vigente.</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0.5rem; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-weight:500; line-height:1.2; color:#212529; font-size:1.25rem; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; letter-spacing:normal; orphans:2; text-align:left; text-transform:none; white-space:normal; widows:2; word-spacing:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">6. Responsabilidad</font></font></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1rem; text-align:left; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El usuario asume todos los riesgos relacionados con el rendimiento y el uso del programa, incluido el riesgo de no obtener el beneficio esperado, el riesgo de una falla del software despu&eacute;s de la instalaci&oacute;n del programa, etc.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">En ning&uacute;n caso el propietario de los derechos de autor es responsable de al Usuario por cualquier da&ntilde;o (que incluye, entre otros, cualquier p&eacute;rdida de ganancias e informaci&oacute;n confidencial u otra informaci&oacute;n, los da&ntilde;os causados ​​por una interrupci&oacute;n del negocio, p&eacute;rdida de ingresos, facturaci&oacute;n, reputaci&oacute;n o datos comerciales, oportunidades comerciales desatendidas, cualquier indirecta , da&ntilde;os incidentales, especiales, punitivos o consecuentes) relacionados con el uso del programa o la imposibilidad de usar el programa.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">En el caso de que la ley del pa&iacute;s del Usuario no reconozca ninguna limitaci&oacute;n de responsabilidad, o la responsabilidad del Propietario de los derechos de autor sea reconocida por el tribunal competente, el Propietario de los derechos de autor ser&aacute; responsable solo por los da&ntilde;os reales incurridos por el uso del Programa si el da&ntilde;o es causado por un agravio del propietario de los derechos de autor, o si el da&ntilde;o es causado por las razones que el propietario de los derechos de autor sab&iacute;a o deber&iacute;a haber sabido.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El monto m&aacute;ximo de responsabilidad del propietario de los derechos de autor se limita al monto de la compensaci&oacute;n que el usuario pag&oacute; por una licencia completa.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Las limitaciones de responsabilidad del propietario del copyright que se especifican en esta secci&oacute;n del Acuerdo se aplican al Programa y a todos los objetos asociados.</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0.5rem; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-weight:500; line-height:1.2; color:#212529; font-size:1.25rem; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; letter-spacing:normal; orphans:2; text-align:left; text-transform:none; white-space:normal; widows:2; word-spacing:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">7. Terminaci&oacute;n de la Licencia y Acuerdo</font></font></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1rem; text-align:left; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El Acuerdo es efectivo hasta su finalizaci&oacute;n.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El Acuerdo y la Licencia completa junto con las Licencias adicionales apropiadas tambi&eacute;n se rescinden inmediatamente despu&eacute;s de que el Usuario viole cualquier parte de este Acuerdo sin previo aviso adicional del Propietario de los derechos de autor.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Y el Usuario acepta eliminar inmediatamente el Programa junto con todas las copias, modificaciones y actualizaciones, y cualquier Derivado basado en el Programa.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El territorio para este Acuerdo ser&aacute; el mundo entero.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El Usuario tiene derecho a rescindir la Licencia completa junto con las Licencias adicionales apropiadas en cualquier momento al suspender el Acuerdo y eliminar el Programa junto con todas sus copias, modificaciones y actualizaciones, y Derivados basados ​​en el Programa, junto con el env&iacute;o de una notificaci&oacute;n apropiada a El propietario de los derechos de autor.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El Acuerdo se considerar&aacute; rescindido desde el momento en que el Propietario de los derechos de autor reciba la notificaci&oacute;n del Usuario.</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h5 style=\"box-sizing:border-box; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0.5rem; font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-weight:500; line-height:1.2; color:#212529; font-size:1.25rem; font-style:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; letter-spacing:normal; orphans:2; text-align:left; text-transform:none; white-space:normal; widows:2; word-spacing:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; background-color:#ffffff; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">8. Disposiciones finales</font></font></h5>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1rem; text-align:left; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Este Acuerdo cumple con la ley vigente de la Rep&uacute;blica del Per&uacute;.&nbsp;La ley apropiada para interpretar este Acuerdo y todas las relaciones que provienen del alcance del Acuerdo es la ley sustantiva y adjetiva de la Rep&uacute;blica del Per&uacute;.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Si alguna condici&oacute;n de este Acuerdo por alguna raz&oacute;n se vuelve inaplicable, o es invalidada o declarada inv&aacute;lida por el tribunal competente, entonces se considera como una omisi&oacute;n del texto de este Acuerdo, que, sin embargo, de ninguna manera afectar&aacute; la legitimidad y validez de las otras condiciones.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Los t&iacute;tulos de las secciones en el texto del Acuerdo son solo por conveniencia y no tienen fuerza legal independiente, y no deben interpretarse en relaci&oacute;n con las condiciones del Acuerdo.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El Usuario reconoce que ha le&iacute;do este Acuerdo cuidadosamente y lo ha entendido completamente, y acepta aceptar sus t&eacute;rminos y condiciones.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El propietario de los derechos de autor puede cambiar unilateralmente este Acuerdo.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El usuario recibe una notificaci&oacute;n de los cambios a trav&eacute;s de un aviso en el sitio https://foxchanger.com/ donde se publica el texto de los cambios.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Los cambios en las condiciones del Acuerdo entrar&aacute;n en vigencia en la fecha de publicaci&oacute;n en el sitio https://foxchanger.com/, a menos que se especifique lo contrario en la publicaci&oacute;n, y ser&aacute;n obligatorios para la aceptaci&oacute;n y satisfacci&oacute;n del Usuario para su uso posterior. Del programa.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El usuario reconoce que el propietario de los derechos de autor puede sufrir da&ntilde;os si no se respetan las condiciones de este acuerdo y, por lo tanto, el usuario acepta que el propietario de los derechos de autor tiene derecho a utilizar cualquier forma de protecci&oacute;n de los derechos violados e intereses leg&iacute;timos, incluida la apelaci&oacute;n directa a el tribunal correspondiente sin necesidad de cumplir con el procedimiento de liquidaci&oacute;n de reclamos.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Cualquier disputa que surja o est&eacute; relacionada con este Acuerdo, incluida cualquier pregunta relacionada con su interpretaci&oacute;n, ejecuci&oacute;n, terminaci&oacute;n o validez, se resolver&aacute; finalmente mediante arbitraje de conformidad con las Reglas del Tribunal de Arbitraje Comercial Internacional de la C&aacute;mara de Comercio e Industria de la Rep&uacute;blica del Per&uacute;&nbsp; (en adelante, las &quot;Reglas&quot;), cuyas Reglas se consideran incorporadas por referencia en esta secci&oacute;n.&nbsp;El panel de arbitraje consistir&aacute; en un (1) &aacute;rbitro seleccionado de acuerdo con las Reglas.&nbsp;El idioma que se utilizar&aacute; en el procedimiento arbitral ser&aacute; el Peruano.&nbsp;La ley aplicable del Acuerdo ser&aacute; la ley sustantiva de la Rep&uacute;blica del Per&uacute;.&nbsp;El arbitraje se llevar&aacute; a cabo en Arequipa, Rep&uacute;blica del Per&uacute;.&nbsp;La medida cautelar para el tema de la disputa puede ser solo la suspensi&oacute;n de la recuperaci&oacute;n sobre la base del documento ejecutado cuestionado por el demandante o cualquier otro documento bajo el cual las sanciones se recuperan de manera no aceptable.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El demandante asumir&aacute; los costos propios y de la otra Parte asociados con la resoluci&oacute;n o el arbitraje de cualquier disputa, y todos los honorarios y otros costos del procedimiento de arbitraje ser&aacute;n pagados por el demandante.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El laudo dictado por el arbitraje ser&aacute; definitivo y vinculante para ambas Partes, y el fallo sobre el laudo podr&aacute; presentarse en cualquier tribunal que tenga jurisdicci&oacute;n sobre el mismo.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Los costos asociados con la resoluci&oacute;n o el arbitraje de cualquier disputa, y todos los honorarios y otros costos del procedimiento de arbitraje ser&aacute;n pagados por el demandante.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El laudo dictado por el arbitraje ser&aacute; definitivo y vinculante para ambas Partes, y el fallo sobre el laudo podr&aacute; presentarse en cualquier tribunal que tenga jurisdicci&oacute;n sobre el mismo.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Los costos asociados con la resoluci&oacute;n o el arbitraje de cualquier disputa, y todos los honorarios y otros costos del procedimiento de arbitraje ser&aacute;n pagados por el demandante.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El laudo dictado por el arbitraje ser&aacute; definitivo y vinculante para ambas Partes, y el fallo sobre el laudo podr&aacute; presentarse en cualquier tribunal que tenga jurisdicci&oacute;n sobre el mismo.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Las Partes reconocen la validez legal de los documentos enviados por correo electr&oacute;nico.&nbsp;</font><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">Los documentos enviados por el propietario del copyright se consideran creados en la forma escrita adecuada si se env&iacute;an desde support@foxchanger.com y / o manager@foxchanger.com.</font></font><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\" />\r\n<font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">El Programa est&aacute; protegido por la ley de la Rep&uacute;blica del Per&uacute; y la legislaci&oacute;n internacional sobre derechos de autor y propiedad intelectual.</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:1rem; text-align:left; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#212529\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\"><font style=\"box-sizing:border-box; vertical-align:inherit\">&copy; 2020 Foxchanger</font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\";}', '1');
